# Scrollback check (lines lost in some terminals with scroll regions): two tasks make the
# viewport taller, then numbered lines are written, far more than the screen shows. After
# `quit`, scroll up in the terminal window: the three runs of `count 00001/00100` to
# `count 00100/00100` must all be there, in order. `count` exists in debug builds only.
# Run it with TILEFAB_SCROLL_MODE=region and =screen to compare.
wait 1
line start alpha
line start beta
wait 1
line count 100
wait 1
line count 100
wait 1
line count 100
wait 2
line quit
wait 1
